#
# TLS 1.2 client implementation (RFC 5246) with AES-128-GCM cipher suite
# (TLS_RSA_WITH_AES_128_GCM_SHA256, 0x009C) and RSA key exchange.
#
# Provides TlsSocket wrapping a raw TCP file descriptor with:
#   - Full TLS 1.2 handshake (ClientHello → Finished)
#   - AES-128-GCM record encryption/decryption (RFC 5288)
#   - TLS PRF via HMAC-SHA-256 (RFC 5246 Section 5)
#   - Record layer framing and sequence number tracking
#
# The AES block cipher is implemented in software using the standard
# S-box lookup table, ShiftRows, MixColumns, and AddRoundKey operations.
# GCM mode provides authenticated encryption with 128-bit tags.
#
# This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
# it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by
# the Free Software Foundation, either version 3 of the License, or
# any later version.
#
